      "M11_calibration": "Positive source-based taxonomic OR ecological connection with explicit alternatives and mismatches; no diet-matching requirement.",
      "Benthic_fish_16": "Retain seven nearshore/benthic analogue labels at Very low, with feeding mismatch and provider conflict explicit. Superseded unresolved draft is not current.",
      "Mola_mola": "Adopt partial gelatinous-feeding fish analogues Nearshore rockfish 35 and Widow rockfish 52 at Very low after all represented fish groups were compared. Source catch allocation is an assumed proxy; no physiology or habitat equivalence claimed.",
